{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54672","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晕边珥，一珥喜来生。\n两珥欲来相解意，又言败（川本、辛本、京本作「拜」）将摄公卿，此术甚分明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}